{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/518edfdeb8ee4fa73b302ab9d1262d0c.avif?t=1771814571\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>SoundBoard</strong> is a simple and fun app for anyone who wants to bring more life to calls, streams, and gaming sessions. With it, you can play sounds with just one click, organizing everything in a practical panel full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>SoundBoard</strong> library is <strong>built by the community</strong>: like the sounds you enjoy most, discover new creations, or add your own sounds to contribute. Plus, you can <strong>customize your home screen</strong> with exclusive categories, set shortcuts for every situation, and make the experience completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With an intuitive design and focus on practicality, SoundBoard ensures you have fun without complications, whether in live streams, calls with friends, or gaming moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn any moment into something special with <strong>SoundBoard</strong> \u2014 your personalized sound hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc9c The SoundBoard Team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">- <strong>MAKE SOUNDBOARD YOUR OWN WAY</strong> -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/19aa4139cd1b9db6a7c17478c375a684.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/19aa4139cd1b9db6a7c17478c375a684.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SoundBoard offers a wide selection of themes so you can make the app look just like you. Each theme completely changes the visual style, bringing different vibes for every type of user. Just pick the one that suits you best and enjoy an experience the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- EASY TO USE -</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/9da4020589b2defd8fa29d6733514b2d.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/9da4020589b2defd8fa29d6733514b2d.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adding sounds to favorites in <strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> is simple and fast. Just open the library, tap the heart on the sound you like, and it instantly appears in your personal list, ready to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- REAL-TIME MONITORED FOLDERS -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/17956ceabe76f6e107c73a6240c8014e.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/17956ceabe76f6e107c73a6240c8014e.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/17956ceabe76f6e107c73a6240c8014e.mp4?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Monitored Folders give you total freedom to organize your sounds your way. The app automatically detects new files and keeps your library always up to date, effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A HUGE LIBRARY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/f32367ed0c4a24305a9711454fea9d1a.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/f32367ed0c4a24305a9711454fea9d1a.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SoundBoard features a massive library of sounds submitted by the community. Explore, discover new sounds, and always find something that fits the moment. Everything organized for easy access and use however you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- ORGANIZE YOUR WAY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/eee96010758b109b57459a086690fcae.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/eee96010758b109b57459a086690fcae.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Organizing your favorite sounds in SoundBoard is quick and practical. Adjust names, categories, and shortcuts in just a few clicks, keeping everything perfectly arranged. That way, your sounds are always accessible without effort and ready for the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- CUSTOMIZE YOUR PROFILE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/7769f2ee2ac5d6becdbc24a56065a79d.poster.avif?t=1771814571\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/7769f2ee2ac5d6becdbc24a56065a79d.webm?t=1771814571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SoundBoard lets you customize your profile your way. Choose a theme, write your description, and sync everything with your Steam photo and background.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914510?t=1771814571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/888b6a946df38c57858903e8b88933a979e8d85a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771814571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/30039aad6464468741d5ea4bca7fb2222558a76c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771814571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/30039aad6464468741d5ea4bca7fb2222558a76c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771814571","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":